Description: return *this from the vector assignment operator
 The template operator= of the vector class "l" has no return statement.
 Flowing off the end of a non-void function is undefined behaviour in C++:
 current GCC versions emit a trap there (SIGILL at -O0) or generate code
 that crashes (SIGSEGV at -O2) as soon as the metaball surface is built.
